{"type":"result","subtype":"success","is_error":false,"duration_ms":144727,"duration_api_ms":143727,"num_turns":14,"result":"","stop_reason":"end_turn","session_id":"4957b4bd-96a9-4371-a4f3-ae9334cc68e7","total_cost_usd":0.69406175,"usage":{"input_tokens":9,"cache_creation_input_tokens":47415,"cache_read_input_tokens":363458,"output_tokens":3738,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":47415,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"","iterations":[],"speed":"standard"},"modelUsage":{"claude-opus-4-6":{"inputTokens":9,"outputTokens":3738,"cacheReadInputTokens":363458,"cacheCreationInputTokens":47415,"webSearchRequests":0,"costUSD":0.5715677499999999,"contextWindow":200000,"maxOutputTokens":64000},"claude-haiku-4-5-20251001":{"inputTokens":66,"outputTokens":5084,"cacheReadInputTokens":378855,"cacheCreationInputTokens":47298,"webSearchRequests":0,"costUSD":0.12249400000000002,"contextWindow":200000,"maxOutputTokens":32000}},"permission_denials":[],"structured_output":{"evidence":["All 6 required budget tracking tests pass: test_total_n_helper_sums_all_pools, test_total_c_helper_sums_all_pools, test_closed_system_n_conservation, test_closed_system_c_conservation, test_water_change_n_export_tracked, test_budget_ledger_zero_cost_when_disabled","Full tank_core test suite passes (all test binaries report 0 failures, including budget_tracking, water_change_mass_balance, cycling, chemistry, dissolved_oxygen, shrimp_population, save_load, events, etc.)","cargo clippy -p tank_core produces zero warnings","Canonical total_nitrogen() and total_carbon() are defined once in types/budget.rs via total_nitrogen_mg() and total_carbon_mg(), exposed through TankState methods in state.rs:241-251","total_nitrogen_mg includes all N-bearing pools: ammonia, nitrite, nitrate, DON, substrate_layers[*].nutrient_store_mg_n_total, plant guilds, algae (suspended + periphyton), microbes (decomposer + AOB + NOB + comammox), shrimp (adults + juveniles), detritus (particulate + fine). Substrate N inclusion matches the reviewer correction.","total_carbon_mg includes all C-bearing pools: DIC, DOC, plant guilds, algae (suspended + periphyton), microbes, shrimp, detritus","BudgetLedger is Optional<BudgetLedger> on Engine (engine.rs:24). When None, maybe_record_stage (engine.rs:213-229) skips BudgetTotals::from_state computation entirely — the tick variable is None, so the before/after snapshots are never computed. This is true zero-cost when disabled.","Per-stage granular recording covers all 12 PlayerAction variants (action_budget_label is exhaustive match) plus 11 system stages (temperature, nitrogen_cycle, chemistry, dissolved_oxygen, shrimp_stress, hourly_events, invariants, daily_plants, daily_algae, daily_microfauna, stability_tracker, daily_shrimp, daily_filter_clogging, daily_biofilter_maturity)","dissolved_feed_residue_g_total is explicitly excluded from both N and C totals with documented comments explaining it mirrors DOC/DON and would double-count","Closed-system conservation tests use a quiescent state with zero biological activity (no biomass, no light) and verify |initial - final| < 1e-6 over 24 ticks, plus per-tick net deltas < 1e-6","Water change export test verifies the action:water_change entry records the correct nitrogen outflow (water_n_before * 0.25) with zero inflow, demonstrating explicit export attribution rather than unexplained loss"],"findings_or_gaps":["The test_total_n_helper_sums_all_pools test computes 'expected' using the same stoichiometric helpers (plant_nitrogen_mg, algae_nitrogen_mg, etc.) rather than hand-calculated literal constants. This is acceptable for verifying pool coverage (all pools are listed) but does not independently validate the stoichiometry math itself. The stoichiometric helpers are simple enough that this is low risk.","The closed-system conservation tests use a quiescent (zero-biomass, zero-detritus) state to avoid triggering active biological systems that may have pre-existing stoichiometric imbalances. This is the correct approach per the project comment guidance ('start with the simple approach'), but it means the conservation check does not yet validate active-growth scenarios. The implementation notes this as an outstanding risk.","Oxygen tracking is simpler than N/C: it only tracks dissolved_oxygen_mg_total (clamped to non-negative) rather than summing across biomass pools. This is consistent with the deliverable's 'track oxygen demand where feasible' wording — O2 is not stored in biomass in the same way N and C are.","The BudgetLedger and all types derive Serialize/Deserialize, which is forward-looking for the dependent bead tanksim-6e5.1.2.4 (structured tracing). Good design choice.","No compile-time or test-time check that all biomass-bearing state fields are included in the canonical helpers. The reviewer comment suggested this, but it would require macro-level introspection that's complex for the current phase. The test_total_n_helper_sums_all_pools test serves as a manual checklist."],"follow_up_or_amendments":[],"outcome":"approved"},"fast_mode_state":"off","uuid":"c61ebf5c-ce65-4d4b-8dd9-f9967b91ba7a"}
